# AgentGrove environment variables (example — copy values you need).
#
# The server reads these from its process environment. For the
# OS-managed service, put secrets in `.data/auth.env` (gitignored,
# sourced by scripts/service-run.sh) rather than here.

# --- Server bind / storage -------------------------------------------------
# IP to bind. Default: 127.0.0.1 (loopback, trusts the host).
# AGENTGROVE_BIND=127.0.0.1
# TCP port. Default: 0 (OS-assigned) for the binary; the service uses 4317.
# AGENTGROVE_PORT=4317
# State directory (DB, secrets key, uploads, backups). Default: <cwd>/.data
# AGENTGROVE_STATE_DIR=./.data
# Serve a built FE bundle from this dir (single-origin Docker deploys).
# AGENTGROVE_STATIC_DIR=/app/web

# --- Google auth (OPTIONAL) ------------------------------------------------
# Auth is OFF unless BOTH id and secret are set. When off, the server
# behaves exactly as before (loopback, no login). When on, every request
# outside /api/auth/* + /health requires a valid session cookie.
#
# Register this redirect URI in Google Cloud Console → Credentials →
# OAuth client → Authorized redirect URIs:
#     <AGENTGROVE_PUBLIC_URL>/api/auth/callback
# and the matching JavaScript origin: <AGENTGROVE_PUBLIC_URL>
#
# AGENTGROVE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=xxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
# AGENTGROVE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-secret
# Comma-separated allowed email domains. Empty/unset = any Google account.
# AGENTGROVE_AUTH_ALLOWED_DOMAINS=theysaid.io
# Comma-separated allowed exact emails. Empty/unset = don't restrict by
# email (the domain gate still applies). When set, ONLY these addresses
# may sign in — use it to lock the app to specific people.
# AGENTGROVE_AUTH_ALLOWED_EMAILS=arnab@theysaid.io
# BE origin — builds the OAuth redirect URI (<PUBLIC_URL>/api/auth/callback,
# which Google calls back to). Default: http://localhost:4317
# AGENTGROVE_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:4317
# FE origin to land on after login. Defaults to PUBLIC_URL; set separately
# in dev where the FE (Vite :5173) and BE (:4317) differ.
# AGENTGROVE_APP_URL=http://localhost:5173
